case: unsupported addr
qemu adapter: unsupported loader form: loader,file=bin/ucore.img,addr=0x80000000
qemu adapter: only loader,file=<path>,addr=0x80200000 is supported
exit=2
case: missing addr
qemu adapter: unsupported -device argument: loader,file=bin/ucore.img
exit=2
case: no loader
qemu adapter: expected one -device loader,file=<path>,addr=0x80200000 argument
exit=2
